cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or generator, please cite it as below."
title: "TR-EN Indirect Prompt Injection Dataset (Generator 3)"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Turkish and English indirect prompt-injection dataset built from
  licensed real carriers. Records come in four-member families (clean, injected,
  authorized twin, trigger-benign) with character-level injection spans,
  deterministic witness oracles for attack success, and full provenance.
type: dataset
